# .ai/mcp/tools/ — Project-Specific Governed Tool Definitions
#
# Add project-specific tool checklists here as *.json files.
# See .ai/agents/tools/anticipate-gaps.json for the schema.
#
# IMPORTANT: These are GOVERNANCE DOCUMENTS read by AI agents.
# They are NOT MCP wire-protocol tool definitions.
# Each file defines a tool_name, description, agent checklist, and safety_level.
#
# To wire these as real callable MCP tools, a separate MCP server implementation
# is needed. See .ai/agent-config.yaml (governed_tools_enabled) for the setting.
# The distinction: governed tool checklists tell agents HOW to behave; an MCP
# server would make those tools programmatically callable by the model.
